# AI Chatbot Configuration
# Get your free API keys from:
# - Groq (Recommended - Fast & Free): https://console.groq.com
# - OpenAI (Fallback): https://platform.openai.com

# Primary AI Provider (Groq - FREE & FAST)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_api_key_here

# Secondary AI Provider (OpenAI - Paid backup)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your_openai_api_key_here

# Note: You only need ONE of the above API keys.
# If no API key is provided, chatbot uses rule-based responses (basic but functional).
# Groq is recommended for the best experience - it's free, fast, and has generous limits!

## TrueHost / WHMCS API (for domain search & registration)
# If you're using TrueHost's WHMCS API or similar, provide credentials here.
# Keep these values secret and do NOT commit real secrets to source control.
# The app supports both a single Bearer-style API key (`TRUEHOST_API_KEY`) and
# the WHMCS-style Identifier + Secret pair used by some TrueHost/WHMCS endpoints.

# Example (WHMCS-style):
TRUEHOST_IDENTIFIER=Wh83pN7kbgO5XtQJD2gRrgtvmFfML2ks
TRUEHOST_SECRET=e2GPNwGZMC8M8Dhj1dI25cruFz6dGc94
TRUEHOST_ENDPOINT=https://truehost.co.ke/cloud/includes/api/

# Example (Bearer API):
TRUEHOST_API_KEY=your_truehost_api_key_here
TRUEHOST_API_URL=https://api.truehost.co.ke/v1
